1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,980
Your cat isn't sitting on your laptop to annoy you.

2
00:00:02,980 --> 00:00:04,230
It's sitting on a heater.

3
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:07,160
A laptop runs as warm as your skin,

4
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:10,570
and cats feel best at temperatures that would make you sweat.

5
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:12,930
Their ancestors lived in the desert.

6
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:15,180
That's why it steals your warm seat,

7
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:17,550
and follows the sunbeam across the floor.

8
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:19,110
There's a second reason.

9
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:22,050
The laptop is where your eyes are all day.

10
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:24,860
To your cat, it's the thing stealing your attention,

11
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:26,550
so it sits right on it.

12
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:28,520
And the keys smell like your hands.

13
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:31,510
So next time your cat lies on your keyboard,

14
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:32,633
don't push it off, because
